    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/202201002/2022010020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ボイスレッスンは\r\nもう終わったんじゃなかったか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "終わりの時間になっても連絡がないから\r\n心配になって来てみたんだけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022010020050,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "は、はい\r\nもう終わってますけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201002/2022010020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022010020060,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "でも……\r\n大きな声が出てないって言われて……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201002/2022010020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、それで残って自主練してたのか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022010020070,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……はい……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201002/2022010020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022010020080,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "ソロ曲のレコーディング……\r\nこのままじゃ、うまくいかないから……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201002/2022010020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "念のために聞くけど、体調が悪いとかはないか？\r\nそういうことだったら────",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022010020090,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "い、いえ、そんなことないです！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201002/2022010020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022010020100,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "な、なんだか今日はたまたま\r\n調子が悪いみたいで……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201002/2022010020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022010020110,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "だ、だから……もうちょっと\r\n練習して帰りますね……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201002/2022010020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ……\r\nそれはいいけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "焦らず、小糸のペースでな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022010020120,
