  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "小糸、どうしたんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022010020150,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "ぴゃ……！\r\nぷ、プロデューサーさん……",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201002/2022010020150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははっ\r\nなんだかこの感じ、昨日と一緒だな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……気のせいだったらすまん\r\n小糸、あまり元気がないんじゃないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022010020160,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "そ、そんなこと──",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201002/2022010020160"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1200
  },
  {
    "id": 2022010020170,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………わ、わたし、プロデューサーさんに\r\nたくさん支えてもらってるのに",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "056",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201002/2022010020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022010020180,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "ちゃんと、お返しができてるのかなって\r\n考えちゃったんです……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201002/2022010020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022010020190,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "い、いつも、わたしがお仕事できるように\r\n気を遣ってくれて、支えてくれて",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201002/2022010020190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022010020200,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "それは、当たり前じゃないのに\r\nわたし、頼ってばかりで──",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201002/2022010020200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "小糸……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022010020210,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "そう思ったら…………なんだか──\r\n声が、大きく出なくなっちゃって……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201002/2022010020210"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……俺はもう、小糸にいろいろなものを\r\nお返ししてもらってるよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022010020220,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "え……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201002/2022010020220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "小糸がいつも頑張って……\r\n真剣に仕事に向き合ってくれるから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『２８３さんのアイドルには安心してお仕事を任せられる』\r\n……って言ってもらえるんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは事務所としても、俺としても\r\nすごく嬉しいことなんだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022010020230,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "そ、そうなんですか……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201002/2022010020230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、結果的に小糸が活躍できる場所が\r\nもっと増えるからさ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "小糸が楽しそうに、のびのび活躍してくれること\r\nそれが俺への一番のお返しだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
